"`feedback <https://github.com/OCA/stock-logistics-workflow/issues/new?body=module:%20stock_owner_restriction%0Aversion:%2019.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
